| ADR-003 | SQLite as Local-First Storage with Optional External Sync | Accepted | [`ADR.md`](ADR.md) |
| ADR-004 | SHA-256 Hash-Chained Immutable Audit Log and Event Store | Accepted | [`ADR.md`](ADR.md) |
